WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
Our safe base all relies on you.

2
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:07,550
I heard that Captain Lu completed the mission of finding the granary.

3
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:08,790
Then there will definitely be a good harvest in the fire

4
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:10,910
Can you support our Ping An base with a wave of supplies?

5
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:12,510
We've been having a really hard time lately

6
00:00:13,230 --> 00:00:15,030
If Captain Lu Wen can't support the people in the base,

7
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:17,070
I can send someone over to pick them all up.

8
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:19,680
It's not easy for everyone now

9
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:21,720
Unlike in the past, where the state controlled the ministers

10
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,000
I always thought

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,760
K1 base is the official Datong

12
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,720
Can you help us with these small bases?

13
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:29,570
Captain Luwin

14
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,640
Are you still living in the past?

15
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:37,990
How can he live in the past?

16
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:40,310
He wants to use the country's reputation to pressure you and find you to criticize you.

17
00:00:40,310 --> 00:00:41,670
Let me give you a great name first.

18
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:42,950
If you don't give it, it's selfish.

19
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:44,270
You gave it as a matter of course.

20
00:00:44,270 --> 00:00:47,030
He is good inside and out. Of course he has to pretend to be Miss Lu. I don’t mean it.
